<html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>ReadMe - Alberto Watch Company</title></head><body style="font-family:Calibri,Arial"><h1>Alberto Watch Company</h1><h2>eProject Submission ReadMe</h2><p><b>Project:</b> Responsive Single-Page Watch Catalogue</p><p><b>Installation:</b> Extract ZIP. Open index.html or run python -m http.server 8000 and visit http://localhost:8000.</p><p><b>Technologies:</b> HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, JSON, SVG.</p><p><b>Assumptions:</b> This is an educational demonstration. All product data and prices are illustrative. Verified company contact details and store addresses were not supplied. The visitor counter is browser-local. The contact form opens a mailto draft; no backend exists. Geolocation requires consent and often HTTPS/localhost. Google Maps city search does not confirm store locations. Internet Explorer is legacy and not supported.</p><p><b>SEO:</b> Before publishing, replace example.com in sitemap.xml, supply a real domain, real contact details, verified inventory and canonical/OG URLs.</p><p><b>Testing:</b> See tests/test-plan.csv. <b>Documentation:</b> See docs/Project_Report.docx.</p><p><b>Demo video:</b> Record a short screen capture separately; not included in ZIP.</p></body></html>